<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS3.SSS0.Px2" title="In 5.3 Function vector internevtion ‣ 5 Mechanistic Interpretability Analysis ‣ Understanding In-Context Learning Beyond Transformers: An Investigation of State Space and Hybrid Architectures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Ablating function vector heads</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS4" title="In 5 Mechanistic Interpretability Analysis ‣ Understanding In-Context Learning Beyond Transformers: An Investigation of State Space and Hybrid Architectures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.4 </span>Findings</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In Understanding In-Context Learning Beyond Transformers: An Investigation of State Space and Hybrid Architectures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Conclusions</span></a></li>
