<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S8" title="In Understanding In-Context Learning Beyond Transformers: An Investigation of State Space and Hybrid Architectures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">8 </span>Ethics statement</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S9" title="In Understanding In-Context Learning Beyond Transformers: An Investigation of State Space and Hybrid Architectures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">9 </span>Acknowledgments</span></a></li>
